%% MUPP-083 Admin wish lists: sizes and flipping between kids
flowchart TD
    A[Wish list page of a kid] --> B{Tap}
    B -- Storlekar at the top, R1 --> C[Read-only sizes dialog] --> A
    B -- Ny önskning or Ändra --> D[Form card] --> E{Storlekar at the bottom, R2}
    E -- tap --> F[Sizes dialog on top of the card] -- Esc or Stäng --> D
    B -- Nästa barn or Föregående barn, R3 --> G{Another kid in the parent's list?}
    G -- yes, circular --> H[Wish list page of that kid]
    G -- only one kid --> I[No arrows]
